      786   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
      787     HIDE FRAME F-Main.
      788     IF THIS-PROCEDURE:PERSISTENT THEN DELETE PROCEDURE THIS-PROCEDURE.
      789   END PROCEDURE.
      790   PROCEDURE Display_ :
